==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|desenchanter|lang=frm}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˌdɪsɪnˈtʃɑːnt/|/ˌdɪsɪnˈtʃænt/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˌdɪsɪnˈtʃænt/|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{cx|transitive|lang=en}} To [[free]] from [[illusion]], [[false]] [[belief]] or [[enchantment]]; to [[undeceive]] or [[disillusion]].
# {{rft-sense|lang=en}} To [[nullify]] a [[spell]] or [[magic]] [[enchantment]].

